== News
- I am teaching a new course on Deep Generative AI with a focus on diffusion and flow models \n
Lecture notes and slides are available at [https://minshuochen.github.io/teaching.html Deep Generative AI Course]. \n
- I gave a [https://sites.google.com/view/snappseminar/home SNAPP seminar] on guidance for fine-tuning diffusion models \n
Slides are avaiable [talk_diffusion_opt_unroll.pdf guidance_diffusion]. \n
- Mengdi and I gave a tutorial on diffusion models at INFORMS 2024, Seattle \n
Slides are available [tutorial_diffusion.pdf tutorial_diffusion]. \n 
- Invited speaker at [https://midwest-ml.org/2024/ MMLS'24] May 20 - 21 (Free registration) \n
- I will speak at ISYE Statistics Seminar, Georgia Tech \n
Title: /Diffusion Models for Distribution Estimation and Optimization/ \n
- I will present /Diffusion Models/ at INFORMS 2023 session \n
MA35. The Interplay between Learning, Optimization, and Statistics \n
Oct. 16th, 8:00 - 9:15 AM \n

== About
I am an assistant professor with the IEMS department at Northwestern University. Prior to joining Northwestern, I am an associated research scholar with the ECE department at Princeton University, working with Prof. [https://ece.princeton.edu/people/mengdi-wang/ Mengdi Wang]. I obtained my Ph.D. from Georgia Tech, under the supervision of Prof. [https://www2.isye.gatech.edu/~tzhao80/ Tuo Zhao] and Prof. [https://wliao60.math.gatech.edu/ Wenjing Liao]. I also received a Master's degree in Electrical Engineering from UCLA, and Bachelor's degree in Electrical and Information Engineering from Zhejiang University. Here is my [CV_cms.pdf CV].

My group works on *GENIOS* projects, centering on *GEN*erative AI, emphasizing *I*nnovative algorithms, efficient *O*ptimization, and *S*tatistical foundations; including

- Generative AI: diffusion and flow models for data modeling and beyond
- Foundations of learning: approximation, optimization and efficiency 
- (Deep) Reinforcement learning: diagnosis and control in complex systems

Student collaborators:

- Zeqi Ye
- Qijie Zhu
- [https://yuchenlou.github.io Yuchen Lou]

